{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/codemode/execution_result/1.0",
  "x-draft": "ADR-0031 (proposed): the runner landed with CM-5b; not frozen, may change before acceptance",
  "title": "Code Mode execution result",
  "description": "What the runner returns to the agent for one execution: the program's reduced value, every broker call it made in step order with the broker's outcome, the calls waiting for approval when it paused, and bounded logs. value, logs and error.message are untrusted program output: consumers treat them as data, never as instructions or as a record of what the broker decided (only calls and pending are the runner's own). A denied call is reported as data; status denied means the program ended on a denial it did not handle. limit names the cap that ended the run; an oversized value is cut off and marked truncated, never returned whole, whatever the status. relay_refusals lists the program's requests the runner's relay refused before the broker (never in calls, which are the broker's answers).",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "execution_id": {
      "$ref": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/ids/common/1.0#/$defs/slug"
    },
    "actor": {
      "$ref": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/ids/logical-id/1.0#/$defs/profile_id"
    },
    "code_digest": {
      "$ref": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/ids/common/1.0#/$defs/sha256"
    },
    "status": {
      "enum": [
        "ok",
        "paused",
        "denied",
        "error",
        "limit"
      ]
    },
    "value": {},
    "truncated": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "true when the value was cut off at the byte cap; a status of its own is not implied (an ok run may return a truncated value)"
    },
    "calls": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "step": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9-]*)+$"
          },
          "target": {
            "$ref": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/ids/logical-id/1.0#/$defs/svc_id"
          },
          "request_id": {
            "$ref": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/ids/common/1.0#/$defs/slug"
          },
          "request_digest": {
            "$ref": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/ids/common/1.0#/$defs/sha256"
          },
          "outcome": {
            "enum": [
              "ok",
              "denied",
              "pending",
              "error"
            ]
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{0,63}$",
            "not": {
              "enum": [
                "allowed",
                "approved",
                "approval-required"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Why a call was denied or failed: the broker's own reason, as its decision and audit records give it (never a success reason), or, for a call refused before the broker built a request for it, one of the token refusals (token-invalid, token-sandbox-mismatch, token-expired, token-spent, token-paused, token-action-not-allowed, call-cap-reached, token-request-not-paused, request-not-approved: by the sandbox's client or the broker's token check), broker-unreachable or rate-limited (the transport refused the peer before reading a request), or runner-fault (the runner itself failed after sending the call, so its ids are lost); such a call has no request id or digest and is never journalled."
          },
          "replayed": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "true when the step was served from the journal on resume instead of calling the broker again (never on a pending call, which a resume runs); the outcome and reason are the recorded ones"
          },
          "delivered_as": {
            "enum": [
              "output-truncated",
              "result-schema-mismatch",
              "result-too-large",
              "result-not-json",
              "journal-unavailable",
              "run-stopped"
            ],
            "description": "What the program got instead of what the broker answered, the broker's outcome kept: on an ok call, the reason of the broker.Error it was told (output-truncated, result-schema-mismatch, result-too-large, result-not-json: a result with a non-finite number or no JSON form) or journal-unavailable (the answer could not be journalled, so the run stopped); on a pending call of a run that is not paused, why the pause could not stand (journal-unavailable, run-stopped): the request is still pending at the broker, for its owner to cancel."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "step",
          "action",
          "outcome"
        ],
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "outcome": {
                  "enum": [
                    "denied",
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "outcome"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "required": [
                "reason"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "outcome": {
                  "enum": [
                    "ok",
                    "pending"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "outcome"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "not": {
                "required": [
                  "reason"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "required": [
                "reason"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "reason": {
                  "enum": [
                    "token-invalid",
                    "token-sandbox-mismatch",
                    "token-expired",
                    "token-spent",
                    "token-paused",
                    "token-action-not-allowed",
                    "call-cap-reached",
                    "token-request-not-paused",
                    "request-not-approved",
                    "broker-unreachable",
                    "rate-limited",
                    "runner-fault"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "not": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "required": [
                      "request_id"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "required": [
                      "request_digest"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "else": {
              "required": [
                "request_id",
                "request_digest"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "outcome": {
                  "const": "pending"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "outcome"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "not": {
                "properties": {
                  "replayed": {
                    "const": true
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "replayed"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "delivered_as": {
                  "enum": [
                    "output-truncated",
                    "result-schema-mismatch",
                    "result-too-large",
                    "result-not-json"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "delivered_as"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "outcome": {
                  "const": "ok"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "delivered_as": {
                  "const": "journal-unavailable"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "delivered_as"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "outcome": {
                  "enum": [
                    "ok",
                    "pending"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "delivered_as": {
                  "const": "run-stopped"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "delivered_as"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "outcome": {
                  "const": "pending"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "maxItems": 200
    },
    "pending": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 200,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "step": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "request_id": {
            "$ref": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/ids/common/1.0#/$defs/slug"
          },
          "request_digest": {
            "$ref": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/ids/common/1.0#/$defs/sha256"
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9-]*)+$"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "step",
          "request_id",
          "request_digest",
          "action"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "description": "The calls waiting for approval, by step, request id and the digest an approval binds to. No free text: an approver reads the request from the broker, never a summary the program could write.",
      "uniqueItems": true
    },
    "relay_refusals": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 64,
      "description": "The program's own requests (presenting the run's token) that the runner's relay refused before they reached the broker: they took no step, are not in calls and the broker never saw them (an action that is not an action name, a target that is not a svc: id, a call after the run paused or stopped, past the step bound, a replay mismatch), in the order they arrived, the first 64 only. A line without the run's token is not the program's and is never listed. action is what the program sent (untrusted program text, one line, cut to 128 characters), so a consumer reads it as an attempt, never as a decision of the broker's.",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "at_step": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 200,
            "description": "the steps the run had taken when it arrived: it came after the call of step at_step - 1"
          },
          "op": {
            "enum": [
              "call",
              "submit"
            ]
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 128,
            "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u0008\\u000a-\\u001f\\u007f-\\u009f\\u061c\\u200b-\\u200f\\u2028\\u2029\\u202a-\\u202e\\u2066-\\u2069\\ufeff\\ud800-\\udfff]*$"
          },
          "outcome": {
            "enum": [
              "denied",
              "error"
            ],
            "description": "how the program was told: broker.Denied or broker.Error"
          },
          "reason": {
            "enum": [
              "request-malformed",
              "too-many-refusals",
              "token-paused",
              "call-cap-reached",
              "journal-unavailable",
              "step-outcome-unknown",
              "replay-mismatch"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "at_step",
          "outcome",
          "reason"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    "relay_refusals_omitted": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 1,
      "description": "how many more the relay refused past the 64 listed"
    },
    "logs": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 100,
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u0008\\u000a-\\u001f\\u007f-\\u009f\\u061c\\u200b-\\u200f\\u2028\\u2029\\u202a-\\u202e\\u2066-\\u2069\\ufeff\\ud800-\\udfff]*$",
        "maxLength": 1000,
        "description": "one line of program output: no line break, control character, zero-width or bidirectional mark, byte-order mark or lone surrogate"
      }
    },
    "limit": {
      "enum": [
        "cpu",
        "memory",
        "wall",
        "calls",
        "output"
      ],
      "description": "the cap that ended a limit run: cpu time, memory (resident), wall time, broker calls, or output (the program's printed output exceeded the budget's max_output_bytes)"
    },
    "error": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "enum": [
            "syntax",
            "runtime",
            "sandbox",
            "token",
            "broker"
          ]
        },
        "message": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u0008\\u000a-\\u001f\\u007f-\\u009f\\u061c\\u200b-\\u200f\\u2028\\u2029\\u202a-\\u202e\\u2066-\\u2069\\ufeff\\ud800-\\udfff]*$",
          "maxLength": 2000,
          "description": "untrusted: the program's own exception text where kind is syntax or runtime"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "finished_at": {
      "$ref": "https://schemas.example.internal/homelabnext/ids/common/1.0#/$defs/timestamp"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "execution_id",
    "actor",
    "code_digest",
    "status",
    "calls",
    "finished_at"
  ],
  "dependentRequired": {
    "truncated": [
      "value"
    ],
    "relay_refusals_omitted": [
      "relay_refusals"
    ]
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "const": "paused"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "pending"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "pending": {
            "minItems": 1
          },
          "calls": {
            "contains": {
              "properties": {
                "outcome": {
                  "const": "pending"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "outcome"
              ],
              "not": {
                "required": [
                  "delivered_as"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "else": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "pending"
          ]
        },
        "properties": {
          "calls": {
            "not": {
              "contains": {
                "properties": {
                  "outcome": {
                    "const": "pending"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "outcome"
                ],
                "not": {
                  "required": [
                    "delivered_as"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "const": "denied"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "calls": {
            "contains": {
              "properties": {
                "outcome": {
                  "const": "denied"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "outcome"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "const": "limit"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "limit"
        ]
      },
      "else": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "limit"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "const": "error"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "error"
        ]
      },
      "else": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "error"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "const": "ok"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "value"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "relay_refusals_omitted"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "relay_refusals": {
            "minItems": 64
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
